    "quote": "Manufacturers must report every thermal incident involving overheating, fire, or thermal runaway to the relevant regulator within 24 hours of becoming aware of it, with a preliminary account of known impacts and circumstances. They must provide a complete incident report within 10 calendar days, updating it as material facts emerge."
   },
